    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW217rvRPAeUUaadDdTZqZRwo)_\n\nSecond of three stacked PRs. **Based on #325** (the base is its branch, so merge #325 first and retarget this to `main`). Next: #327 widget.\n\n## What\n- `sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sidebar`: toggles a pop-up side window with the grouped backlinks of the note in the main window.\n  - Sits on the right in slot 1, next to the `vulpea-ui` sidebar (slot 0); side, slot and size are options.\n  - Redraws when the main window shows another note, including when you move through mentions.\n  - Buttons open a note in the main window (`vulpea-ui-visit-note`). Keys: `f` toggle follow, `g` redraw, `q` close.\n- `sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sidebar-toggle-follow` flips `sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sidebar-follow`. It applies only to this sidebar; the widget (next PR) always follows.\n- How it follows: same hooks as `vulpea-ui` (`window-buffer-change-functions`, `window-selection-change-functions`) arming a zero-second timer, and `vulpea-ui--get-main-window` plus `vulpea-ui--get-note-from-buffer`, so both sidebars show the same note. Those two are private to `vulpea-ui`, so an update that renames them would break following (documented in the doc).\n- New shared helper `sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sorted`, also used by the Org view.\n- Literate doc updated in bullets; `.el` re-tangled from it. No key is bound yet.\n\n## Tested\n- 14 ERT tests pass (`emacs --batch -l ert -l tests/sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-test.el`, Emacs 29.3): real side window creation, toggle, follow, pinned, non-note buffer keeps the last note, one timer for both hooks, button opens the note, hooks removed on close. Vulpea and `vulpea-ui` are stubbed.\n- **Not run** in the real Emacs or with the real `vulpea-ui`/vault, so the real hook timing, window layout next to the `vulpea-ui` sidebar and the private-function names are untested.\n\nNo CHANGELOG edit, per the nightly-tidy rule.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAyV71uz259d2Xv3kV\n",
